  "description": "Compile, validate, and persist speech recognition grammar binary in Windows applications using Microsoft SAPI, Microsoft Speech Platform, and Microsoft WindowsMedia speech recognition engines.\n\nSpeech recognition grammar syntax supported includes Microsoft SAPI XML and W3C SRGS XML. \n\nUse GrammarKit in the Chant Developer Workbench to interactively create, edit, and test speech recognition grammars before deploying with applications and VoiceXML.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation/grammarkit.\n\nSamples are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/grammarkit for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
